BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL .00315 Tw (Measurement datasets are becoming larger, more complex, and are increasingly used to support critical applications) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.134009 Tw (such as manufacturing, health, and environmental monitoring. Reliable interpretation of these measurements) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.949508 Tw (requires accompanying uncertainty and error-covariance information - however, this is often overlooked. Where) Tj T* 0 Tw (available, such information lacks standardisation and could, in principle, be highly complex and large.) Tj T* ET
