BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 2.821721 Tw (The goal of this Uncertainty metadata Naming Conventions \(UNC\) specification is to provide a standardised) Tj T* 0 Tw .130315 Tw (metadata format for storing the accompanying uncertainty information with measurement datasets. This includes the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.462435 Tw (magnitude of the uncertainty, the probability distribution it describes, and the structure of the error-correlation) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.757888 Tw (between the elements of a dataset. This format is intended to support fully capturing the content of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.311281 Tw (error-covariance matrices associated with measurement data in a compact structure, by parameterising) Tj T* 0 Tw (error-correlation with a simple set of metadata.) Tj T* ET
